# Test environment only

This workspace is for the isolated test stack. Do not deploy, check, or change production unless the user explicitly says production.

## Test services

- API: `sokana-private-api-dev`
- Dashboard: `sokana-front-end-dev`
- Database: `sokana-phi-postgres-dev` / `sokana_private_dev`
- Dashboard URL: `https://sokana-front-end-dev-46lcr3n2qa-uc.a.run.app`
- API URL: `https://sokana-private-api-dev-46lcr3n2qa-uc.a.run.app`

## Production names to avoid

- `sokana-private-api`
- `sokana-front-end`
- `sokana-phi-postgres` / `sokana_private`

A push to `main` updates production Cloud Build only. The test services stay on their last manual deploy until `scripts/dev-env/deploy-cloudrun.sh` and `scripts/dev-env/deploy-frontend.sh` are run.
